</reflection>

<final_translation>
Create an animation of the curve y = 0.5 * x^2. Display a tangent line moving along the curve and show the updated slope value in real-time. The slope of the tangent line at any point (x, y) on the curve is given by the derivative of the function, which is y' = x.
</final_translation>
